.\EXT. PARKING LOT - CONTINUOUS
..Hale's car idles under a flickering streetlight.
.((to himself)
..   
._HALE
.((into phone)
.:She knows something.
.((quietly)
.:I'll call you back.
.%Check whether the parking lot scene
.%
.%needs a second camera angle.
./CUT TO:
.\INT. HALE'S APARTMENT - LATER
.:Nobody home.
._HALE
